  "notes": "selfoss RSS reader. Dark charcoal sidebar (#191718) with a teal vertical stripe at its right edge and teal Mark as read button; main area on a faint diagonal-hatched light-grey texture. Each article row is a single line: small colored square source favicon with initials, 16px title, saturated colored tag pills (each tag has its own color, matching the swatch in the sidebar), then 11px grey metadata joined by bullets (source, author, relative time, read time). Unread rows have a teal left border and dark title; read rows lose the border and are greyed. Some items carry a 500px thumbnail inline. Clicking a row expands it in place with content and an action bar (Star, Mark as read, Open, share icons). Search is collapsed behind a magnifier button."
